&lt;p&gt;As a Working Student in Recruitment Support, you will play a key role in driving our recruitment tools migration and system optimization. You will ensure seamless data accuracy, support initial candidate application workflows, and help maintain precise talent documentation across our recruitment platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
