&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and strong organizational skills for handling large volumes of recruitment data accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (written and spoken); German proficiency is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available to work up to 20 hours per week on-site or hybrid in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong digital affinity and comfort working with modern SaaS tools and spreadsheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
