&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Throughout our worldwide network of experts, clients and communities, we are renowned for our leadership in fire protection engineering – a legacy of responsibility we have proudly upheld since 1939. Today, our expertise extends broadly across closely related security and risk-based fields – from accessibility consulting and risk analysis to process safety, forensic investigations, security risk consulting, emergency management, digital innovation and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our engineers and consultants collaborate to solve complex safety and security challenges, ensuring our clients can protect what matters most. For over 80 years, we have helped mitigate risks that threaten lives, property and reputations. Through technology, expertise and industry-leading research, we remain dedicated to our purpose of making our world safe, secure and resilient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we believe that creating and sustaining a culture of trust, integrity and professional growth starts with putting our people first. Our employees are our greatest strength, and we value the unique perspectives and talents they bring to our organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our wide range of Global Employee Networks connect people from across the organization, supporting career development and providing forums for individuals to share experiences on topics they’re passionate about. Together, we are cultivating a connected culture where everyone has the opportunity to learn, grow and succeed together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us to grow your career?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are the largest fire consultancy in Europe with offices located in Belgium, Finland, Denmark, Italy, and the UK &amp;amp; Ireland. Our reputation for providing innovative, design-focused solutions has made us the consultant of choice for many of Europe’s leading property clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Technical Director you will be an integral part of a dynamic technical team, working with other experienced Engineers, Surveyors and teams including our Forensics division. You will work on the industry&#39;s leading technical projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working with us offers an exciting range of opportunities to develop your career within a supportive and diverse team that always strives to do the right thing for our people, clients and communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Jensen Hughes have a rare and exciting opportunity for a talented Technical Director to join our market leading London team and help us drive excellence across our projects and deliver world class life safety solutions to our varied client base. Our London team have had a record-breaking year with some truly impressive successes to shout about, now is a great time to join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Technical Director, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring safety and compliance within the built environment. Your expertise will contribute to innovative solutions that protect lives, property, and reputations across diverse industries. This position is integral to our Fire &amp;amp; Building Safety team, where you will collaborate with industry leaders to address complex safety challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Professional Awareness: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay updated on technical matters in the fire industry, assimilating and synthesising developing technical issues to provide timely updates and briefings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Fire Engineering Professionals: &lt;/strong&gt;Advise and deliver complex solutions for large construction engineering projects within leading consultancies, ensuring high standards of fire safety engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Take control of current and future projects, ensuring that financial targets are met and exceeded while developing existing relationships with key clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: Foster a culture of technical excellence and team engagement, becoming the go-to expert for developing key client relationships in this discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Liaison&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as the primary point of contact for clients, providing expert advice and solutions tailored to their needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Discussions: &lt;/strong&gt;Facilitate discussions with design teams, building control, and fire services to ensure seamless project execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Attend industry conferences to network and embrace emerging trends and best practices in fire safety engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervise and Train: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor and supervise graduate engineers, fostering their professional development and integration into the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To set you up for success in this role from day one, the following qualifications and experience are required:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background: &lt;/strong&gt;A strong background in fire engineering, preferably within a consultancy environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;A bachelor’s degree or higher in Fire Engineering or a related field, such as Mechanical Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Status&lt;/strong&gt;: Ideally a Chartered Engineer or actively working towards this status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independence: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to undertake works &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;independently,&lt;/span&gt; demonstrating initiative and self-management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship Skills&lt;/strong&gt;: A desire and ability to mentor and manage junior professionals, contributing to their growth and success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting Your Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We understand the importance of flexibility and balance. We&#39;re happy to discuss hybrid, part-time, and flexible working arrangements to suit both you and the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-SG1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jensen Hughes is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability or protected veteran status.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we embrace innovation and understand that people are increasingly using artificial intelligence (AI) tools like ChatGPT and other generative platforms to learn, prepare and communicate.&amp;nbsp; We have provided some guidelines regarding the responsible use of AI in the recruitment process.&amp;nbsp; Please click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jensenhughes.com/careers/responsible-use-of-ai-in-the-jensen-hughes-recruitment-process&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The security of your personal data is important to us. Jensen Hughes has implemented reasonable physical, technical, and administrative security standards to protect personal data from loss, misuse, alteration, or destruction. We protect your personal data against unauthorized access, use, or disclosure, using security technologies and procedures, such as encryption and limited access. Only authorized individuals may access your personal data for the purpose for which it was collected, and these individuals receive training about the importance of protecting personal data.&amp;nbsp; Jensen Hughes is committed to compliance with all relevant data privacy laws in all areas where we do business, including, but not limited to, the GDPR and the CCPA.&amp;nbsp; Additionally, our service providers are contractually bound to maintain the confidentiality of personal data and may not use the information for any unauthorized purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Policy on use of 3rd party recruiting agency for direct placements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jensen Hughes will occasionally augment a recruiting search through agencies for certain positions when business conditions warrant. Jensen Hughes will not accept resumes, inquiries or proposals from recruiting agencies as an acceptable method to consider a candidate. 3rd party recruiting agencies must sign a standard Jensen Hughes agreement after being evaluated and accepted by a Human Resources or Talent Acquisition manager, or member of the talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and employees of Jensen Hughes are not authorized to accept resumes, engage in fee-based searches through recruiting firms or sign a search agreement. Please note this policy does not apply to “staffing firms” or firms that are involved with hiring temporary staff. Any recruiting agency interested in being considered may contact our recruiting team at jensenhughesrecruiting.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Title: Tech Lead&lt;br&gt;Department: Engineering&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Summary&lt;br&gt;As a Tech Lead at CreateFuture, you will use your technical and leadership skills to lead&lt;br&gt;and support diverse client projects. Depending on the engagement, this includes&lt;br&gt;hands-on coding, software architecture, solution design or delivery leadership and project&lt;br&gt;management, ensuring a high standard of delivery in everything we do.&lt;br&gt;We focus on high-value, high-impact client outcomes, and we’re not afraid to challenge&lt;br&gt;the status quo. You should be curious, pragmatic, and operate well in ambiguous&lt;br&gt;environments.&lt;br&gt;As a technology consultancy, it’s important for us to not only deliver reliable, scalable&lt;br&gt;solutions but to be looking at future trends and other high-impact developments. Your&lt;br&gt;curiosity for technology and its application to business opportunities is highly valued&lt;br&gt;within the company. We are disrupting consultancy through the use of Artificial&lt;br&gt;Intelligence and radical thinking in our approach. We&#39;re doing something different, and&lt;br&gt;that’s realising significant benefits for our clients. We want you to share that same&lt;br&gt;ambition.&lt;br&gt;You will also manage a team of technical direct reports, who are themselves working on&lt;br&gt;client projects, for whom you will provide actionable feedback, technical guidance and&lt;br&gt;mentoring, fostering a continuous improvement, growth and consultancy mindset.&lt;br&gt;You will work with clients at every level to understand their problems, set expectations,&lt;br&gt;and maximise business value, representing CreateFuture as an engagement lead.&lt;br&gt;Role Requirements&lt;br&gt;● Proven, hands-on technical leader delivering complex software.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrate thought-leadership; supporting our clients and colleagues to&lt;br&gt;understand, through modern technology and process, what is possible for their&lt;br&gt;business/craft.&lt;br&gt;● Line-manage a team of engineers while maintaining personal delivery&lt;br&gt;contributions.&lt;br&gt;● Commercial experience in at least one: Java, .NET, Python, or TypeScript (backend&lt;br&gt;or frontend).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial experience with at least one major cloud (Amazon Web Services,&lt;br&gt;Microsoft Azure, or Google Cloud Platform) and modern infrastructure practices&lt;br&gt;(containers, continuous integration/continuous delivery, infrastructure as code).&lt;br&gt;● Strong delivery fundamentals: estimation, planning, and risk/issue/dependency&lt;br&gt;management; escalates early with clear options and impacts.&lt;br&gt;● Communicate designs and trade-offs clearly to technical and non-technical&lt;br&gt;stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;● Skilled in difficult conversations and actionable feedback; sets clear standards and&lt;br&gt;holds people accountable.&lt;br&gt;Desirable:&lt;br&gt;● Tailor ways of working (Scrum or Kanban) to context and drive continuous&lt;br&gt;improvement.&lt;br&gt;● Experience in change transformation projects that involved significant Artificial&lt;br&gt;Intelligence adoption.&lt;br&gt;● Breadth across multiple languages or disciplines (e.g., Rust, test automation,&lt;br&gt;DevOps/platform engineering).&lt;br&gt;● Experience across multiple clouds and cloud-native services.&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to recruitment and pre-sales in a consultancy context.&lt;br&gt;● Represent CreateFuture in the external tech community.&lt;br&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Communicate designs, trade‐offs, and constraints in the context of client goals.&lt;br&gt;● Lead architecture, solution design, and documentation; make pragmatic&lt;br&gt;technology choices.&lt;br&gt;● Contribute code where appropriate; set engineering standards; ensure reviews,&lt;br&gt;testing, and maintainability.&lt;br&gt;● Troubleshoot complex issues; drive root‐cause fixes and follow‐up actions.&lt;br&gt;Delivery leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Own technical outcomes: scope, estimate, plan, and track to agreed goals.&lt;br&gt;● Highlight risks, issues, and dependencies; escalate early with clear options,&lt;br&gt;impacts, and recommendations.&lt;br&gt;● Ensure actionable backlogs and realistic plans; communicate timelines and team&lt;br&gt;shape needs.&lt;br&gt;People leadership (enable, unblock, hold to account):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Guide direct reports to set themselves clear personal goals, and hold them&lt;br&gt;accountable for realising them.&lt;br&gt;● Proactively remove impediments across technical, process, and organisational&lt;br&gt;boundaries.&lt;br&gt;● Hold colleagues accountable for commitments and standards; address&lt;br&gt;performance issues promptly.&lt;br&gt;● Provide targeted guidance and feedback; recognise achievements.&lt;br&gt;● Line‐manage direct reports; run core rituals (team meetings, 1:1s, objectives,&lt;br&gt;reviews).&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to hiring.&lt;br&gt;Client leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Build trusted relationships at all levels; translate business needs into technical&lt;br&gt;plans.&lt;br&gt;● Manage expectations and scope; articulate value and trade‐offs; identify follow‐on&lt;br&gt;opportunities.&lt;br&gt;● Represent CreateFuture as the engagement lead.&lt;br&gt;Optional/community:&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to delivery practices and standards&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to pre‐sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior / Staff Data Scientist, you will help shape how PlayStation measures the impact of products, features and commercial initiatives through world-class experimentation, causal inference and applied data science.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working at the intersection of data science, machine learning, product and commercial strategy, you will develop innovative measurement methodologies, define best practices, and provide technical leadership that enables teams across PlayStation to make faster, more confident business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role goes beyond traditional A/B testing. You will solve complex measurement problems where controlled experiments are difficult or impossible, applying modern causal inference, statistical modelling and machine learning techniques to generate robust business insights. You will collaborate closely with product, engineering, analytics and business teams to raise the standard of experimentation and evidence-based decision-making across the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to influence strategic decisions impacting millions of PlayStation players while helping establish best-in-class measurement practices across one of the world&#39;s leading entertainment companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop innovative measurement methodologies across experimentation, causal inference and advanced analytics that improve the quality, reliability and scalability of business decision-making across PlayStation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design robust measurement approaches across randomised experiments, quasi-experimental methods and observational causal inference where controlled experimentation is impractical.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Research, evaluate and prototype statistical, machine learning and AI techniques to solve complex real-world measurement challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply advanced data science and machine learning techniques where appropriate to complement experimentation and support complex business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and promote best practices for experiment design, statistical analysis and causal measurement across multiple product and business teams, helping scale experimentation across PlayStation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with senior business leaders, product managers, engineers and analysts to identify high-impact measurement opportunities and ensure product and commercial decisions are supported by rigorous evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering teams to influence the evolution of PlayStation&#39;s experimentation platform and measurement capabilities, ensuring statistical best practices are embedded into future platform development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership across multiple product and commercial domains, influencing measurement strategy, analytical standards and long-term technical direction through expertise and collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor and develop analysts and data scientists, helping raise technical capability and analytical excellence across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Champion a culture of evidence-based decision-making by educating stakeholders, sharing best practices, and communicating advances in experimentation, causal inference and applied data science.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stay current with emerging developments in statistics, machine learning and AI, identifying opportunities to improve measurement capabilities and analytical workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Represent the team across PlayStation, building strong partnerships, engaging senior stakeholders, and promoting technical excellence in data science and experimentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s degree (or equivalent industry experience) in Statistics, Economics, Mathematics, Computer Science, Data Science or another quantitative discipline. PhD preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong industry experience (5+ years) applying experimentation, causal inference, statistical modelling and measurement science to solve complex business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in experimental design, A/B testing and modern causal inference methods, including quasi-experimental approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience applying advanced data science, machine learning and statistical modelling techniques to solve complex business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expert-level proficiency in Python and SQL for large-scale analytical workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience developing reusable analytical methodologies, frameworks or libraries that improve measurement quality and consistency across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence technical direction, promote best practices and drive adoption through collaboration, technical leadership and senior stakeholder engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management, executive communication and influencing skills, with the ability to translate complex analytical concepts into clear business recommendations for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Curiosity, creativity and a pragmatic approach to solving ambiguous, high-impact business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working in gaming, digital products, consumer technology, e-commerce or subscription businesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern data engineering and analytics tooling such as Databricks, Snowflake, Git and Airflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with modern business intelligence and data visualisation tools such as Tableau, Domo or Power BI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience applying AI tools, including large language models (LLMs), to improve data science workflows and analytical productivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership through mentoring, publications, conference presentations, open-source contributions or internal communities of practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Influence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Measurement strategy for PlayStation&#39;s largest product and commercial initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experimentation best practices adopted across multiple business functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strategic product and commercial decisions through rigorous causal evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The evolution of PlayStation&#39;s measurement and experimentation capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Technical excellence in experimentation, causal inference and applied data science across the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Shape how PlayStation measures product and commercial success across a global business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Influence strategic decisions affecting millions of players worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solve challenging real-world problems using cutting-edge experimentation, causal inference and machine learning techniques.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with talented scientists, engineers and product leaders on high-impact initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive the adoption of best practices in experimentation and evidence-based decision-making across PlayStation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continue developing your technical expertise while mentoring and growing others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
